  "ReactData": {
    "AddToOrderMarkup": null,
    "Copies": [
      "Made of alloy <span class=\"Wrd\">steel,</span> these screws are the standard for high-strength <span class=\"Wrd\">fastening.</span> Use them in high-load applications such as <span class=\"Wrd\">dies,</span> <span class=\"Wrd\">presses,</span> and heavy <span class=\"Wrd\">equipment.</span> The <span class=\"Wrd\">deep,</span> six-point socket keeps the hex key from slipping out and damaging the <span class=\"Wrd\">drive.</span>",
      "Length is measured from under the <span class=\"Wrd\">head.</span>",
      "<b>Black</b><b>-</b><b>Oxide</b> <b>Alloy</b> <span class=\"Wrd\"><b>Steel</b><b>—</b></span>Best for dry environments since moisture will cause these screws to <span class=\"Wrd\">rust.</span> They have a <span class=\"Wrd\">dark,</span> matte <span class=\"Wrd\">appearance.</span>"
    ],
